    },
    {
      "displayText": "나루림, 기분 풀어~\n늘 먹던 그거 먹으러 갈까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B8E8B9BC002C0020AE30BD840020D480C5B4007E000AB2980020BA39B3580020ADF8AC700020BA39C73CB7EC0020AC08AE4C003F001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나룸!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B8F800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇구나... 저, 트레이너님?\n부탁 하나 해도 될까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD6CB098002E002E002E0020C800002C0020D2B8B808C774B108B2D8003F000ABD80D0C10020D558B0980020D574B3C40020B420AE4CC694003F001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 나루림이 지금 일종의 파업 중이라\n일을 하질 않아서요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020B098B8E8B9BCC7740020C9C0AE080020C77CC885C7580020D30CC5C50020C911C774B77C000AC77CC7440020D558C9C80020C54AC544C11CC694002E001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "평소대로라면 솔레유 카페에 가서\n그거를 먹이면 기분이 좋아지는데,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n제가 지금 일하는 중이라 갈 수가 없네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3C9C18CB300B85CB77CBA740020C194B808C7200020CE74D398C5D00020AC00C11C000AADF8AC70B97C0020BA39C774BA740020AE30BD84C7740020C88BC544C9C0B294B370002C00100001BE00000AC81CAC000020C9C0AE080020C77CD558B2940020C911C774B77C0020AC080020C218AC000020C5C6B124C694002E001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 말인데\n나루림과 잠깐 어울려 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n솔레유 카페는 사우스사이드 스트리트를\n곧장 가다 보면 나올 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020B9D0C778B370000AB098B8E8B9BCACFC0020C7A0AE500020C5B4C6B8B8240020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100001BE01000AC194B808C7200020CE74D398B2940020C0ACC6B0C2A4C0ACC774B4DC0020C2A4D2B8B9ACD2B8B97C000AACE7C7A50020AC00B2E40020BCF4BA740020B098C62C0020AC70C608C694002E001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나루림과 같이\n솔레유 카페에 다녀와 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B8E8B9BCACFC0020AC19C774000AC194B808C7200020CE74D398C5D00020B2E4B140C6400020C8FCC138C694002E001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
